    <string name="about_privacy_title">Your privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">Nufo has no accounts, no analytics and no ads. Photos are analysed on your phone. History is stored only on this device and is excluded from cloud backups.</string>
    <string name="about_data_title">Where the data comes from</string>
    <string name="about_data_body">Packaged products come from Open Food Facts, a non-profit database built by volunteers and manufacturers, with thousands of Greek products. Generic foods come from the U.S. Department of Agriculture. Every result names its source and last update.</string>
    <string name="about_missing_title">When a product is missing</string>
    <string name="about_missing_body">Nufo never guesses. You\'ll see «Not available», and you can add the product to Open Food Facts so it\'s there for everyone.</string>
